msgid "Tools menu"
msgstr "Tools menu"

msgid ""
"The **Tools** menu holds the windows for looking into the machine and "
"changing it. The right-click menu over the picture has the same list "
"under **Tools**."
msgstr ""
"El menú **Tools** reúne las ventanas para mirar dentro de la máquina y "
"cambiarla. El menú del clic derecho sobre la imagen tiene la misma lista "
"en **Tools**."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{icon}`cheats` **Cheats...** - trainers and pokes for the program that "
"runs; see [Cheats](cheats.md)."
msgstr ""
"{icon}`cheats` **Cheats...** — entrenadores y POKE para el programa en "
"marcha; consulta [Cheats](cheats.md)."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{icon}`bug` **Debugger** - stops the machine and shows what is inside it;"
" see [Debugger](debugger.md)."
msgstr ""
"{icon}`bug` **Debugger** — detiene la máquina y muestra lo que hay "
"dentro; consulta [Debugger](debugger.md)."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{icon}`objective` **Watcher** - registers and memory, followed while the "
"machine runs; see [Watcher](debugger-watcher.md)."
msgstr ""
"{icon}`objective` **Watcher** — registros y memoria, seguidos mientras la"
" máquina funciona; consulta [Watcher](debugger-watcher.md)."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{icon}`rulers` **Screen** and {icon}`note` **Sound Chips** - two panels "
"of the Debugger in windows of their own, described below."
msgstr ""
"{icon}`rulers` **Screen** y {icon}`note` **Sound Chips** — dos paneles "
"del Debugger en ventanas propias, descritos más abajo."

msgid "Screen and Sound Chips windows"
msgstr "Screen and Sound Chips windows"

msgid "![The Screen window](images/dbg-screen-window.png)"
msgstr "![La ventana Screen](images/dbg-screen-window.png)"

msgid "The Screen window"
msgstr "La ventana Screen"

msgid "![The Sound Chips window](images/dbg-sound-window.png)"
msgstr "![La ventana Sound Chips](images/dbg-sound-window.png)"

msgid "The Sound Chips window"
msgstr "La ventana Sound Chips"

msgid ""
"**Tools > Screen** and **Tools > Sound Chips** move the **Screen** and "
"**Sound Chip** panels out of the Debugger into windows of their own. The "
"same command again puts the panel back. In the Classic preset the keys "
"are Alt+S and Alt+A; the Modern preset has no keys for them."
msgstr ""
"**Tools > Screen** y **Tools > Sound Chips** sacan los paneles **Screen**"
" y **Sound Chip** del Debugger a ventanas propias. El mismo comando otra "
"vez devuelve el panel. En el preajuste Classic las teclas son Alt+S y "
"Alt+A; el preajuste Modern no tiene teclas para ellos."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The button at the top right of each panel, {icon}`display` **Show in its "
"own window**, does the same. In the window it is pressed in; click it "
"again, or close the window, to put the panel back in the Debugger. While "
"the panel is out, its tab in the Debugger says so, with a **Bring it "
"back** or **Bring them back** button."
msgstr ""
"El botón de arriba a la derecha de cada panel, {icon}`display` **Show in "
"its own window**, hace lo mismo. En la ventana está pulsado; haz clic en "
"él otra vez, o cierra la ventana, para devolver el panel al Debugger. "
"Mientras el panel está fuera, su pestaña en el Debugger lo indica, con un"
" botón **Bring it back** o **Bring them back**."

msgid ""
"The windows work without the Debugger: they follow the machine while the "
"machine runs, one picture a frame (in fast mode, one in ten frames). The "
"settings are the same as in the panel. Each window keeps its place and "
"size, and a window that was open when you quit opens again at the next "
"start."
msgstr ""
"Las ventanas funcionan sin el Debugger: siguen a la máquina mientras la "
"máquina está en marcha, una imagen por fotograma (en modo rápido, una "
"cada diez fotogramas). Los ajustes son los mismos que en el panel. Cada "
"ventana conserva su posición y su tamaño, y una ventana que estaba "
"abierta al salir se vuelve a abrir en el siguiente arranque."

msgid "Tools"
msgstr "Tools"

msgid "Screen window"
msgstr "ventana Screen"

msgid "Sound Chips window"
msgstr "ventana Sound Chips"

msgid "Show in its own window"
msgstr "Show in its own window"

